### Find jobs by customer phone number
GET {{baseUrl}}/job/mobile/5550101000

### Find jobs with return dates in a range
GET {{baseUrl}}/job/dates?startDate=2026-11-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z&endDate=2026-12-31T23%3A59%3A59.999Z

### Add a price record
POST {{baseUrl}}/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shirt_price": 400,
  "pant_price": 500
}

### Get the latest prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/price

### Back up database collections
POST {{baseUrl}}/db/backup

### Restore database collections
# WARNING: This permanently replaces the Price, JobData, Customer, and Admin collections.
# The ZIP file must exist on the server and contain data.json.
POST {{baseUrl}}/db/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "C:\\path\\to\\backup.zip"
}
